  "notes": "Alternative glucose/gluconate degradation pathways. Four ED variants with different substrate entry points and phosphorylation strategies: Classic (M00008) uses glucose via phosphorylation. Non-phosphorylative (M00309) uses gluconate without phosphorylation. Semi-phosphorylative gluconate (M00308) and galactonate (M00633) variants use mid-pathway phosphorylation. Additionally, gluconate_transport and galactose_catabolism pathways provide alternative entry points that can short-circuit the full ED pathways by delivering intermediates (D-gluconate, D-galactonate) directly into downstream steps.",
